    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49762.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Okay, Senator, I think we might be talking about two different things here. What exactly is it that you think the internet is or isn't?",
