  },
  {
    "episode_id": 49762,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49762.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "The internet is not something that you just dump something on. It's not a big truck. It's a series of tubes. And if you don't understand those tubes can be filled, and if they're filled, when you put your message in, it gets in line, it's gonna be delayed by anyone that puts in that tube, enormous amounts of material, enormous amounts of material.",
