        "text": "The metaphor of 'tubes' accurately captures key structural properties of internet infrastructure.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members will interpret the 'tubes' analogy as meaningful and relevant to network behavior.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Delays in data transmission are caused by congestion at specific points in the network.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s understanding of internet mechanics is authoritative and trustworthy.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "It is important for users to recognize limitations in how quickly their messages can travel online.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
