  },
  {
    "episode_id": 49762,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49762.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Okay, now, Senator, I'm not exactly sure if comparing the internet to a series of tubes like one might find between gerbil cages is exactly that good of a metaphor. or unless you were thinking maybe tube tops which of course would explain the whole porn issue. Let's just say we sidestepped now the whole what is the internet issue. I really brought you on to talk more about the issue of net neutrality and I'm sure being not just a US senator but also the chairman of the US state senate committee on commerce science and transportation. that you have some access to some really good intel and information. Can you share some of that with us?",
