        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The World Wide Web should be evaluated within a framework of fairness and open access.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "A two-tier internet system undermines equitable access to online resources.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Proponents of a two-tier internet system have harmful intentions.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Public discourse on technology policy requires reference to credible external sources.",
