      },
      {
        "text": "Fairness in internet access applies to both service providers and end-users.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The net neutrality movement originated from actions and statements by large carriers.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Those supporting net neutrality are not responsible for starting the movement.",
